# BLACKLINE demo

Follow [docs/design/BLACKLINE_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md](docs/design/BLACKLINE_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md). Inspect `src/styles/demo/blackline.css` before adding styles.

- Colours, spacing, type, radii, borders, and motion use theme tokens (`--theme-*`, `--bl-*`). Do not scatter raw hex in components.
- New pages wrap `DemoLayout` so `<html data-theme="blackline">` is inherited. Import theme CSS only from that layout.
- Scope styles under `[data-theme="blackline"]`. Never leak into Kersivo landing, admin, or other shops.
- Alternate `data-surface="dark"` / `"light"`. Interactive pieces need hover, focus, disabled, and `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Do not introduce Kersivo red, gold, neon, gradients, glassmorphism, or barber clichés.
- Keep WCAG AA contrast, visible focus (`--theme-focus`), and ≥44px targets.

```css
/* BAD */
.hero { color: #f4f1ea; background: #0b0c0e; }

/* GOOD */
.bl-section { color: var(--theme-text); background: var(--theme-background); }
```
